        "sourcePages": [
          246
        ],
        "sourceURL": "https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikisource/he/e/ed/Apocrypha_Kahana_A2.pdf#page=246"
      },
      "decision": "approvePrintedMark",
      "finding": "The full second nun has a rounded left-facing node midway between the upper head and lower foot. It is joined on its right to the stem, while white recesses above and below delimit it from both head and foot. Detached nun dagesh in same-page הַתַּנִּין and next-page וְהִנֵּה fixes this interior position. The adjacent first nun and both ordinary nuns in הִנְנוּ lack this medial side projection. The preserved node certifies the printed dagesh. Add only U+05BC at baseline unit scalar56, after the existing nun+hiriq cluster; preserve all earlier scalars and order.",
